{"id": "c086aeeb-50bf-4f60-a24e-34d2745ed36e", "slug": "nexus-connect-your-ecosystem", "title": "Nexus - Connect Your Ecosystem", "description": "Nexus Connect Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Nexus - Connect Your Ecosystem\"\ndescription: \"Nexus Connect Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#6366F1\"\n  secondary: \"#E2E8F0\"\n  accent: \"#C7D2FE\"\n  background: \"#FAFAFA\"\n  surface: \"#E2E8F0\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#CBD5E1\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nexus - Connect Your Ecosystem\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 74; favorites: 8; remixes: 1.\nTags: pricing, section, animated, cta, charts, billing.\n## Overview\nNexus Connect Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\n\nNexus Platform Integrations Resources Pricing Log In Get Started Connect Your Ecosystem Without Friction Unify your tools, teams, and data in one beautiful interface. Experience a seamlessly integrated workflow designed…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Connect Your Ecosystem Without Friction.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #6366F1, secondary #E2E8F0, accent #C7D2FE, background #FAFAFA, surface #E2E8F0, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Geist for display moments and Geist for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "Here is the full updated code with the right side improved into a compass schema, while keeping the noodle connection lines/nodes. Source file used:\n\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexus - Connect Your Ecosystem</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        .font-geist { font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"bg-[#fafafa] min-h-screen flex flex-col font-geist antialiased overflow-hidden text-slate-900 relative m-0\">\n\n\n\n<main class=\"flex-1 flex items-center justify-center w-full min-h-screen relative\">\n    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden\">\n        <div class=\"absolute top-[-10%] right-[-5%] w-[800px] h-[800px] bg-indigo-100/50 blur-[120px] rounded-full\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-[-20%] left-[-10%] w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-rose-50/60 blur-[100px] rounded-full\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-[1200px] aspect-auto lg:aspect-[16/9] isolate min-h-[600px] mt-20 lg:mt-0 pointer-events-none\">\n\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1200 675\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n            <path d=\"M 160 480 L 480 480 Q 500 480 500 460 L 500 360 Q 500 340 520 340 L 900 340\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n            <path d=\"M 700 340 L 700 400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n            <path d=\"M 700 190 L 900 190\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n            <path id=\"anim-path-1\" d=\"M 280 480 L 480 480 Q 500 480 500 460 L 500 360 Q 500 340 520 340 L 900 340\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"transparent\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n        </svg>\n\n        <div id=\"particle-1\" class=\"absolute w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-indigo-500 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_8px_2px_rgba(99,102,241,0.4)] opacity-0 z-10\" style=\"left: 0; top: 0; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\"></div>\n        <div id=\"particle-2\" class=\"absolute w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-rose-400 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_8px_2px_rgba(251,113,133,0.4)] opacity-0 z-10\" style=\"left: 0; top: 0; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-20 flex flex-col justify-center w-full lg:w-[50%] pl-8 lg:pl-20 pointer-events-none\">\n            <div class=\"pointer-events-auto relative z-30\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-5xl lg:text-7xl leading-[1.1] text-slate-900 mb-6 max-w-[800px] font-light tracking-tighter\" id=\"reveal-title\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-2\"><span class=\"word inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">Connect</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-2\"><span class=\"word inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">Your</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-2\"><span class=\"word inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">Ecosystem</span></span>\n                    <br>\n                    <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-2\"><span class=\"word inline-block translate-y-[110%] text-indigo-600\">Without</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-2\"><span class=\"word inline-block translate-y-[110%] text-indigo-600\">Friction</span></span>\n                </h1>\n\n                <p class=\"text-slate-500 text-base leading-relaxed max-w-[420px] mb-10 font-normal\">\n                    Unify your tools, teams, and data in one beautiful interface. Experience a seamlessly integrated workflow designed for modern scale.\n                </p>\n\n                <div class=\"relative inline-flex group cursor-pointer\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-indigo-200 rounded-full blur-md group-hover:bg-indigo-300 transition-all duration-500 opacity-60\"></div>\n                    <button class=\"relative bg-white text-slate-900 border border-slate-200 px-6 py-3 rounded-full text-sm font-normal flex items-center gap-2 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02]\">\n                        Explore Integrations\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" class=\"text-slate-400 group-hover:text-indigo-500 transition-colors\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"absolute z-30 flex items-center gap-2 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"left: calc((160 / 1200) * 100%); top: calc((480 / 675) * 100%); transform: translateY(-50%);\">\n            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm overflow-hidden\">\n                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/2f563338-39fa-47ea-9761-658d4f3f84db_800w.jpg\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm overflow-hidden\">\n                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/4f5668c5-fc4a-44e0-bc5e-a664189d3c31_800w.jpg\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"absolute w-2 h-2 bg-indigo-500 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_10px_2px_rgba(99,102,241,0.2)] z-30\" style=\"left: calc((380 / 1200) * 100%); top: calc((480 / 675) * 100%); transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"absolute z-30 flex items-center gap-2 p-2 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100 bg-indigo-50/50 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm\" style=\"left: calc((580 / 1200) * 100%); top: calc((340 / 675) * 100%); transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\">\n            <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-500\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:folder-with-files-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-rose-400\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-square-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"absolute z-30 bg-white border border-slate-200 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md text-xs text-slate-600 shadow-sm tracking-wide pointer-events-auto\" style=\"left: calc((700 / 1200) * 100%); top: calc((250 / 675) * 100%); transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-90deg);\">\n            Data Unified\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"absolute z-30 w-8 h-8 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm overflow-hidden\" style=\"left: calc((760 / 1200) * 100%); top: calc((460 / 675) * 100%); transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\">\n            <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/eca707cc-a5b7-439a-b4fd-247f6106c2e1_800w.jpg\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"absolute z-30 w-7 h-7 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm text-slate-400\" style=\"left: calc((1035 / 1200) * 100%); top: calc((190 / 675) * 100%); transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-linear\" width=\"14\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- RIGHT SIDE: Compass Schema -->\n        <div id=\"compass-schema\" class=\"absolute z-10 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full pointer-events-none\" style=\"right: -260px; width: 820px; height: 820px;\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,rgba(255,255,255,0.95)_0%,rgba(239,246,255,0.55)_45%,transparent_75%)] blur-2xl\"></div>\n\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 820 820\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full overflow-visible\">\n                <defs>\n                    <linearGradient id=\"compassStroke\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n                        <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#6366f1\" stop-opacity=\"0.55\"/>\n                        <stop offset=\"50%\" stop-color=\"#c7d2fe\" stop-opacity=\"0.18\"/>\n                        <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0f172a\" stop-opacity=\"0.08\"/>\n                    </linearGradient>\n                </defs>\n\n                <circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"410\" r=\"375\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"410\" r=\"295\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e5e7eb\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"410\" r=\"235\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#eef2ff\" stroke-width=\"42\"/>\n\n                <g id=\"compass-ticks\" style=\"transform-origin:410px 410px;\">\n                    <circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"410\" r=\"265\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"54\" stroke-dasharray=\"1 14\" opacity=\"0.75\"/>\n                    <circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"410\" r=\"210\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 9\" opacity=\"0.55\"/>\n                </g>\n\n                <g id=\"compass-needle\" style=\"transform-origin:410px 410px;\">\n                    <path d=\"M410 130 L426 410 L410 690 L394 410 Z\" fill=\"url(#compassStroke)\" opacity=\"0.45\"/>\n                    <path d=\"M130 410 L410 394 L690 410 L410 426 Z\" fill=\"#6366f1\" opacity=\"0.08\"/>\n                </g>\n\n                <circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"410\" r=\"145\" fill=\"white\" opacity=\"0.55\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"410\" r=\"105\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c7d2fe\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 6\"/>\n            </svg>\n\n            <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 w-[168px] h-[168px] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-[0_25px_80px_rgba(15,23,42,0.12)] flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-auto\">\n                <div id=\"core-spinner\" class=\"absolute inset-[-7px] rounded-full border border-dashed border-indigo-300 border-t-indigo-500\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-[-18px] rounded-full bg-indigo-400/10 blur-xl animate-pulse\"></div>\n                <div class=\"relative w-[132px] h-[132px] rounded-full overflow-hidden\">\n                    <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/d14dc069-558a-4c51-8aad-5cc237f9b61d_3840w.jpg\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-white/10 mix-blend-overlay\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"compass-node absolute z-20 w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-md flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-500 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"left: 220px; top: 165px;\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:globus-linear\" class=\"text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"compass-node absolute z-20 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-md overflow-hidden p-1 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"left: 132px; top: 315px;\">\n                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/77415a2e-dcbc-4748-a29d-fced4821881a_800w.jpg\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-full\">\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"compass-node absolute z-20 w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-md flex items-center justify-center text-amber-500 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"left: 235px; top: 570px;\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pie-chart-2-linear\" class=\"text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"compass-node absolute z-20 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-md overflow-hidden p-1 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"left: 430px; top: 120px;\">\n                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/c92852bb-a510-405a-85ab-ffa0fde136a4_800w.jpg\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-full\">\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"compass-node absolute z-20 w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-md flex items-center justify-center text-rose-400 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"left: 110px; top: 475px;\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-check-linear\" class=\"text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"compass-node absolute z-20 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border border-indigo-100 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-auto\" style=\"left: 545px; top: 165px;\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-indigo-100/70 rounded-full blur-md animate-pulse\"></div>\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:database-linear\" class=\"text-indigo-500 text-[20px] relative z-10\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</main>\n\n<script>\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n    gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n    gsap.to(\".word\", {\n        y: \"0%\",\n        duration: 1.2,\n        stagger: 0.1,\n        ease: \"power4.out\",\n        scrollTrigger: {\n            trigger: \"#reveal-title\",\n            start: \"top 85%\",\n        }\n    });\n\n    const coreSpinner = document.getElementById('core-spinner');\n    const compassTicks = document.getElementById('compass-ticks');\n    const compassNeedle = document.getElementById('compass-needle');\n    const compassNodes = document.querySelectorAll('.compass-node');\n\n    let angle = 0;\n    let tickAngle = 0;\n    let needleAngle = 0;\n\n    function animateRotations() {\n        angle += 0.35;\n        tickAngle -= 0.04;\n        needleAngle += 0.08;\n\n        if (coreSpinner) coreSpinner.style.transform = `rotate(${angle}deg)`;\n        if (compassTicks) compassTicks.style.transform = `rotate(${tickAngle}deg)`;\n        if (compassNeedle) compassNeedle.style.transform = `rotate(${Math.sin(needleAngle * 0.02) * 8}deg)`;\n\n        compassNodes.forEach((node, index) => {\n            const float = Math.sin(angle * 0.018 + index) * 6;\n            node.style.transform = `translateY(${float}px)`;\n        });\n\n        requestAnimationFrame(animateRotations);\n    }\n\n    requestAnimationFrame(animateRotations);\n\n    const path1 = document.getElementById('anim-path-1');\n    const particle1 = document.getElementById('particle-1');\n    const particle2 = document.getElementById('particle-2');\n\n    if (path1 && particle1 && particle2) {\n        const pathLength = path1.getTotalLength();\n        let progress1 = 0;\n        let progress2 = 0.5;\n\n        function animateParticles() {\n            progress1 += 0.002;\n            progress2 += 0.002;\n\n            if (progress1 > 1) progress1 = 0;\n            if (progress2 > 1) progress2 = 0;\n\n            const pt1 = path1.getPointAtLength(progress1 * pathLength);\n            const pt2 = path1.getPointAtLength(progress2 * pathLength);\n\n            particle1.style.left = `${(pt1.x / 1200) * 100}%`;\n            particle1.style.top = `${(pt1.y / 675) * 100}%`;\n            particle1.style.opacity = Math.sin(progress1 * Math.PI).toFixed(2);\n\n            particle2.style.left = `${(pt2.x / 1200) * 100}%`;\n            particle2.style.top = `${(pt2.y / 675) * 100}%`;\n            particle2.style.opacity = Math.sin(progress2 * Math.PI).toFixed(2);\n\n            requestAnimationFrame(animateParticles);\n        }\n\n        requestAnimationFrame(animateParticles);\n    }\n});\n</script>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n", "preview_file_name": "nexus-connect-your-ecosystem.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/nexus-connect-your-ecosystem.jpg", "source_name": "nexus-connect-your-ecosystem-DESIGN.md", "views": 197, "forks": 10, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T22:02:05.032584+00:00"}